- 2018 SIAM Conference on Applied Linear Algebra (SIAM-ALA18),Hong Kong Baptist University,Hong Kong, China,May 4-8,2018.\n-Contributed Talk: Parametrized quasi-soft thresholding operator for compressed sensing and matrix completion.
